      "jp": "妖怪島を荒らしているのは、果たして一体誰なのか――。\nその真実を明らかにすべく、主人公たちはナキメを追っていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "8f56866e2450a8235cc6e0f07c5a2fe1e72783052fae1ab9dfe8ed83f7a196e3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "요괴 섬을 어지럽히는 자는 과연 누구인가――.\n그 진실을 밝히기 위해 주인공 일행은 나키메를 쫓고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "33859fdcd24cccddce4fc8417549613d7d4eed77c979d682c8f5fea37dec7ff8:000000_-7774050681028953934:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "妖怪島を荒らしているのは、果たして一体誰なのか――。\nその真実を明らかにすべく、主人公たちはナキメを追っていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5d6ffafaccb88bfdb8ff2c1dbcbbff241d27d921231fb09f3e2c46ed85d96463",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ご主人――。\nナキメを追うのは――賛成だが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "0cfbfcc661efff3929ae1e471b2c54041cb5058ea7a94fb381f9b7284b8c59a1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주인님――.\n나키메를 쫓는 건―― 찬성이다만――.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
