        "",
        "シルバ牛頭鬼",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ご主人――。\nナキメを追うのは――賛成だが――。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "シルバ牛頭鬼",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e9e939255d22bfb66a887034754040bd6adbca6b8ac7e17b1a049ad008f10915",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ナキメが島を荒らしていない――とすると、\n犯人は――一体――誰なんだ――？",
      "jp_sha256": "0cc8a40d44429fe670af80567625c12eed8cc9c9a33cc37120886109ca234038",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나키메가 섬을 어지럽힌 게―― 아니라면,\n범인은―― 대체―― 누구지――?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "33859fdcd24cccddce4fc8417549613d7d4eed77c979d682c8f5fea37dec7ff8:000000_-7774050681028953934:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
