        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ナキメが島を荒らしていない――とすると、\n犯人は――一体――誰なんだ――？",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "シルバ牛頭鬼",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "574ce59315274b104d594d30c316a93dc5e71b9e300ad39519c2a83cb2b1c074",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それは……僕にも分かりません。\n今のところ手がかりは、\n犯人は式神を操る能力を持っている、ということだけですね。",
      "jp_sha256": "93b0a016c36f1287809acd49937a4a64577f970dee5aebd8fa7f64aa88b07387",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그건…… 저도 모릅니다.\n지금으로서 단서는\n범인이 식신을 조종하는 능력을 지녔다는 것뿐이네요.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "33859fdcd24cccddce4fc8417549613d7d4eed77c979d682c8f5fea37dec7ff8:000000_-7774050681028953934:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それは……僕にも分かりません。\n今のところ手がかりは、\n犯人は式神を操る能力を持っている、ということだけですね。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c2c9473c0e2160a4da5e122502ed00ff278460ee3f90551fdba41255917ca48b",
