    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "bb129497c7975d35dd88e7c5c90c509feafb405897bc17f3b7096aba9c0e17d9",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いえ。もしかしたら、それも間違っていたんじゃないかと。\n思い返してみれば、\nホヅキさんもシリコさんも操られた感じはありませんでした。",
      "jp_sha256": "eb1cb62db289751859b7f5324ade88a026dabee261054150386f9dbf913818b6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아뇨. 어쩌면 그것도 잘못 알고 있던 게 아닐까 싶어요.\n돌이켜 보면\n호즈키 씨도 시리코 씨도 조종당한 느낌은 없었습니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "33859fdcd24cccddce4fc8417549613d7d4eed77c979d682c8f5fea37dec7ff8:000000_-7774050681028953934:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "いえ。もしかしたら、それも間違っていたんじゃないかと。\n思い返してみれば、\nホヅキさんもシリコさんも操られた感じはありませんでした。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "fa6db3248ce9c430fa5541d162ccceaea11f2db2367ef50f3a8a4811ab935510",
